INFO 07-17 13:27:01 [logger.py:43] Received request cmpl-24742d8c94aa4d61b873904339cf2587-0: prompt: "Let's answer a question directly and concisely.\nQuestion: Context: BSkyB initially charged additional subscription fees for using a Sky+ PVR with their service; waiving the charge for subscribers whose package included two or more premium channels. This changed as from 1 July 2007, and now customers that have Sky+ and subscribe to any BSkyB subscription package get Sky+ included at no extra charge. Customers that do not subscribe to BSkyB's channels can still pay a monthly fee to enable Sky+ functions. In January 2010 BSkyB discontinued the Sky+ Box, limited the standard Sky Box to Multiroom upgrade only and started to issue the Sky+HD Box as standard, thus giving all new subscribers the functions of Sky+. In February 2011 BSkyB discontinued the non-HD variant of its Multiroom box, offering a smaller version of the SkyHD box without Sky+ functionality. In September 2007, Sky launched a new TV advertising campaign targeting Sky+ at women. As of 31 March 2008, Sky had 3,393,000 Sky+ users.\nImplications: 1. Prior to July 1, 2007, BSkyB charged an additional fee for Sky+ PVR usage unless customers had a package that included two or more premium channels.\n2. Starting from July 1, 2007, customers with Sky+ and a BSkyB subscription package received Sky+ as a no-cost extra.\n3. Those who did not subscribe to BSkyB channels could pay an additional monthly fee for Sky+ functionality.\n4. In January 2010, BSkyB made the Sky+ Box standard, offering Sky+ functions to all new subscribers.\n5. With the discontinuation of the non-HD Multiroom box in February 2011, BSkyB offered a smaller SkyHD box without Sky+ functionality.\n6. In September 2007, BSkyB launched a new TV campaign targeting Sky+ to attract women subscribers.\n7. By March 31, 2008, BSkyB had attracted 3,393,000 Sky+ users.\nTopic: Sky (United Kingdom)\nWhat service did BSkyB chare additional subscription fees for?\nAnswer:\n", params: SamplingParams(n=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.0, top_p=1.0, top_k=0, min_p=0.0, seed=None, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[151643], bad_words=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=64, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prompt_logprobs=None, skip_special_tokens=True, spaces_between_special_tokens=True, truncate_prompt_tokens=None, guided_decoding=None, extra_args=None), prompt_token_ids: [10061, 594, 4226, 264, 3405, 5961, 323, 3529, 285, 974, 624, 14582, 25, 9608, 25, 27618, 7891, 33, 15102, 11430, 5107, 15142, 12436, 369, 1667, 264, 14722, 10, 393, 18800, 448, 862, 2473, 26, 10450, 2249, 279, 6757, 369, 30020, 6693, 6328, 5230, 1378, 476, 803, 14848, 11744, 13, 1096, 5497, 438, 504, 220, 16, 5768, 220, 17, 15, 15, 22, 11, 323, 1431, 6310, 429, 614, 14722, 10, 323, 17963, 311, 894, 27618, 7891, 33, 15142, 6328, 633, 14722, 10, 5230, 518, 902, 4960, 6757, 13, 39589, 429, 653, 537, 17963, 311, 27618, 7891, 33, 594, 11744, 646, 2058, 2291, 264, 15088, 11060, 311, 7283, 14722, 10, 5746, 13, 758, 6058, 220, 17, 15, 16, 15, 27618, 7891, 33, 64159, 279, 14722, 10, 8261, 11, 7199, 279, 5297, 14722, 8261, 311, 17439, 2966, 13910, 1172, 323, 3855, 311, 4265, 279, 14722, 10, 19147, 8261, 438, 5297, 11, 8450, 7086, 678, 501, 30020, 279, 5746, 315, 14722, 48920, 758, 7400, 220, 17, 15, 16, 16, 27618, 7891, 33, 64159, 279, 2477, 11278, 35, 11424, 315, 1181, 17439, 2966, 3745, 11, 10004, 264, 9155, 2319, 315, 279, 14722, 19147, 3745, 2041, 14722, 10, 14944, 13, 758, 6122, 220, 17, 15, 15, 22, 11, 14722, 11626, 264, 501, 5883, 12876, 4796, 24132, 14722, 10, 518, 3198, 13, 1634, 315, 220, 18, 16, 5470, 220, 17, 15, 15, 23, 11, 14722, 1030, 220, 18, 11, 18, 24, 18, 11, 15, 15, 15, 14722, 10, 3847, 624, 25216, 10709, 25, 220, 16, 13, 31399, 311, 5768, 220, 16, 11, 220, 17, 15, 15, 22, 11, 27618, 7891, 33, 11430, 458, 5107, 11060, 369, 14722, 10, 393, 18800, 10431, 7241, 6310, 1030, 264, 6328